anguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0206","quote":"頠"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0296","quote":"頠"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0318","quote":"頠"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0379","quote":"頠"}],"identity_note":"前置裴秀/子頠單元具名，完整原raw保留；未在本次selected unit前文另造標記。 本批已暫登本來源身份；未定跨篇同指不作等同合併，本批未新增關係斷言。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AA","source_assertion_id":"a-sgz023-peiqian-wei-father-xiu","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009","quote":"《文章敘錄》曰：秀字季彥。弘通博濟，八歲能屬文，遂知名。大將軍曹爽辟。喪父服終，推財與兄弟。年二十五，遷黃門侍郎。爽誅，以故吏免。遷衛國相，累遷散騎常侍、尚書僕射令、光祿大夫。咸熙中，晉文王始建五等，命秀典爲制度，封廣川侯。晉室受禪，進左光祿大夫，改封钜鹿公，遷司空。著易及樂論，又畫地域圖十八篇，傳行於世。盟會圖及典治官制皆未成。年四十八，泰始七年薨，諡元公，配食宗廟。少子頠，字逸民，襲封。荀綽《冀州記》曰：頠爲人弘雅有遠識，博學稽古，履行高整，自少知名。歷位太子中庶子、侍中尚書。元康末，爲尚書左僕射。趙王倫以其望重，畏而惡之，知其不與賈氏同心，猶被枉害。臣松之案陸機《惠帝起居注》稱「頠雅有遠量，當朝名士也」，又曰「民之望也」。頠理具淵博，贍於論難，著崇有、貴無二論，以矯虛誕之弊，文辭精富，爲世名論。子嵩，字道文。荀綽稱嵩有父祖風。爲中書郎，早卒。頠從父弟邈，字景聲，有雋才，爲太傅司馬越從事中郎，假節監中外營諸軍事。潛少弟徽，字文季，冀州刺史。有高才遠度，善言玄妙。事見荀粲、傅嘏、王弼、管輅諸傳。徽長子黎，字伯宗，一名演，遊擊將軍。次康，字仲豫，太子左衛率。次楷，字叔則，侍中中書令、光祿大夫、開府。次綽，字季舒，黃門侍郎，早卒，追贈長水校尉。康、楷、綽皆爲名士，而楷才望最重。《晉諸公贊》曰：康有弘量，綽以明達爲稱，楷少與琅邪王戎俱爲掾發名，鍾會致之大將軍司馬文王曰：「裴楷清通，王戎簡要。」文王即辟爲掾，進歷顯位。謝鯤爲樂廣傳，稱楷雋朗有識具，當時獨步。黎子苞，秦州刺史。康子純，黃門侍郎。次盾，徐州刺史。次郃，有器望。晉元帝爲安東將軍，郃爲長史，侍中王曠與司馬越書曰：「裴郃在此，雖不治事，然識量弘淹，此下人士大敬附之。」次廓，中壘將軍。楷子瓚，中書郎。次憲，豫州刺史。綽子遐，太傅主簿。瓚、遐並有盛名，早卒。《晉諸公贊》稱憲有清識。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0188","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0008"}],"interpretation_note":"本源明父子支援的近系結構位置；字母不是排行，不據新唐遠譜接祖。"}},{"id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AABB","label":"該","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"該","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0187","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0071","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0151"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","quote":"該"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0187","quote":"該"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028","mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0071","quote":"該"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028","mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0151","quote":"該"}],"review":"source_local_candidate","identity_note":"不是山濤子該、謝該或馮該。次子2可來源明載。 僅按固定裴秀／裴頠完整單元登記；未證同人者不作永久必異斷言。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"parent_person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","source_assertion_id":"a-jin035-xiuwei-gai-wei","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","quote":"初，頠兄子憬為白衣，頠論述世勳，賜爵高陽亭侯。楊駿將誅也，駿党左軍將軍劉豫陳兵在門，遇頠，問太傅所在。頠紿之曰：「向於西掖門遇公乘素車，從二人西出矣。」豫曰：「吾何之？」頠曰：「宜至廷尉。」豫從頠言，遂委而去。尋而詔頠代豫領左軍將軍，屯萬春門。及駿誅，以功當封武昌侯，頠請以封憬，帝竟封頠次子該。頠苦陳憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿，先帝恩旨，辭不獲命。武昌之封，己之所蒙，特請以封憬。該時尚主，故帝不聽。累遷侍中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0143"}],"interpretation_note":"以本源明父／子稱與具名傳主承接配置父系；字母只作結構位置，不作排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}},{"id":"lzb_bsi_bu7","label":"公主（該妻，未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"主","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190","quote":"主"}],"review":"source_local_candidate","identity_note":"尚主明婚姻；不猜繁昌、不推某帝為父，也不先填司馬姓。 僅按固定裴秀／裴頠完整單元登記；未證同人者不作永久必異斷言。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","raw_mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0187","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0071","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0151"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id"