6399","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","quote":"初，頠兄子憬為白衣，頠論述世勳，賜爵高陽亭侯。楊駿將誅也，駿党左軍將軍劉豫陳兵在門，遇頠，問太傅所在。頠紿之曰：「向於西掖門遇公乘素車，從二人西出矣。」豫曰：「吾何之？」頠曰：「宜至廷尉。」豫從頠言，遂委而去。尋而詔頠代豫領左軍將軍，屯萬春門。及駿誅，以功當封武昌侯，頠請以封憬，帝竟封頠次子該。頠苦陳憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿，先帝恩旨，辭不獲命。武昌之封，己之所蒙，特請以封憬。該時尚主，故帝不聽。累遷侍中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0143"}],"interpretation_note":"以本源明父／子稱與具名傳主承接配置父系；字母只作結構位置，不作排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AABB"}],"name_components":[{"id":"name-jin035-xiuwei-gai","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AABB","surname":"裴","ming":"該","hao":null,"title":null,"additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","source_anchor":{"start":146,"end":147,"surface":"該"},"quote":"初，頠兄子憬為白衣，頠論述世勳，賜爵高陽亭侯。楊駿將誅也，駿党左軍將軍劉豫陳兵在門，遇頠，問太傅所在。頠紿之曰：「向於西掖門遇公乘素車，從二人西出矣。」豫曰：「吾何之？」頠曰：「宜至廷尉。」豫從頠言，遂委而去。尋而詔頠代豫領左軍將軍，屯萬春門。及駿誅，以功當封武昌侯，頠請以封憬，帝竟封頠次子該。頠苦陳憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿，先帝恩旨，辭不獲命。武昌之封，己之所蒙，特請以封憬。該時尚主，故帝不聽。累遷侍中。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"surname_basis":{"kind":"contextual_surname_from_fixed_jin035_received_family","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"僅沿本篇已驗父子／父系祖稱與literal全名seed恢復省姓；不由ID、母親、婚配或嗣爵推姓。","source_name_record_id":"name-jin035-xiuwei-xiu","assertion_ids":["a-jin035-xiuwei-wei-xiu","a-jin035-xiuwei-gai-wei"],"literal_source_components":{"surname":null,"ming":"該"},"source_term":"該"},"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"該","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AABB","status":"source_explicit","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0187