c_n2f_AABB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0190","start":190,"end":191,"surface":"主","kind":"person","person_id":"lzb_bsi_bu7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p015:m0193","start":193,"end":194,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":48,"last_line":48,"revision_id":2506399,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/jin035-peixiu-peiwei/raw-projection.json","unit_key":"line048","raw_file_sha256":"b27aa9fc386b5f40990822d615febffcb8b8cd6df3fe6f74585274ff733c12be"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028","text":"初，趙王倫諂事賈后，頠甚惡之，倫數求官，頠與張華復固執不許，由是深為倫所怨。倫又潛懷篡逆，欲先除朝望，因廢賈后之際遂誅之，時年三十四。二子嵩、該，倫亦欲害之。梁王肜、東海王越稱頠父秀有勳王室，配食太廟，不宜滅其後嗣，故得不死，徙帶方；惠帝反正，追復頠本官，改葬以卿禮，諡曰成。以嵩嗣爵，為中書黃門侍郎。該出後從伯凱，為散騎常侍，並為乞活賊陳午所害。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"趙王倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"賈后","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_vc4_gep_*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p028:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期see